# Bun - keep BOTH lockfiles for Cloudflare Pages compat
# bun.lock is the new text lockfile (Bun 1.4 default, committed)
# bun.lockb is the legacy binary lockfile — keep empty file to trigger Cloudflare's Bun detection
# (Bun locally prefers bun.lock, so empty bun.lockb is ignored)
# Do NOT ignore bun.lockb here
